& [AffectedSubjects]
  + Token-Ring Pow-Wow Inference carrier shape
  + register head and governed file-reference binding
  + participant custody and inference-work reassignment
  + language-conditioned action proposal and host dispatch
  + effect-authority separation

& [Intention]
  + preserve and clarify the user's refinement without silently contradicting the existing immutable SemanticRoundToken or claiming that fluent instruction following is self-authorizing motivation

& [Result]
  + the candidate ring carrier is separated into an immutable contract core, versioned register-head table, append-only custody or capability lease, proposal sidecar, and epoch commit receipt
  + file references are bounded as stable locators with snapshot and digest rather than raw process pointers or mutable paths alone
  + assignment changes custody or attention projection through recorded transitions while the contract retains identity
  + language is recognized as causally changing transformer computation and continuation probabilities
  + learned inference proposes plans and structured tool calls, while the agent host validates authority and executes external effects
  + the apparent impulse to act is therefore neither language with magical executive force nor host software doing all semantic interpretation: it is a coupled model-proposal and governed-runtime-dispatch loop

& [EvidenceAndReconciliation]
  + the existing token-ring specification requires one byte-identical round token and append-only custody and observations
  + the existing junction specification keeps authoritative shared state and effects in Cantor rather than provider hidden state
  + the prior language-to-attention source already separates probabilistic language conditioning, structured action candidates, validation, execution, and observation
  + the prior pointer-boundary source already refuses a native durable pointer table and proposes stable external identity resolution

& [Nonclaims]
  + no canonical Token-Ring Pow-Wow profile, implementation authority, provider integration, external effect, consciousness claim, or felt motivational state is formed by this discussion
  + no existing token-ring specification is superseded or modified

& [UnresolvedFrontier]
